180
00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:45.530
Well, first of all, yes, Alex, I have a specific pen I like to use.

181
00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.870
Or a specific type of pen.

182
00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:50.750
I like rollerball ink pens.

183
00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:51.330
Okay.

184
00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:54.930
And I get grumpy when I have to journal with any other pen.

185
00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:55.670
Okay.

186
00:07:55.990 --> 00:08:00.170
I will say I don't like to journal with any pen that smudges and then gets on my hand.

187
00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:00.730
Same.

188
00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:01.370
Okay.

189
00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.690
I also have multiple journals.

190
00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:05.350
